# TLS / signing / tunnel material — NEVER commit.
# NOTE: this does NOT untrack material already committed to history.
# See SECURITY.md and docs/tauditall-2026-08-08.md — those files must be ROTATED.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
.cloudflared/

